Custom programs in Liftoscript
Automatic progressive overload
Myo-reps, drop sets, RPE
iOS, Android and web editor', 'Атлети-любителі силових видів, які хочуть точно налаштовувати програму й прогресію.', 'Recreational strength athletes who want fine control over their program and progression.', 'web,mobile', 'basic', 'published', 0, 'found', @uid, '2026-10-04 00:00:00' FROM DUAL WHERE @new = 1;
