nds indirect calorimetry capabilities. Applications include pulmonology, cardiology, pediatrics, neonatology, sports science, nutrition, critical care, rehabilitation, human performance and longevity research. The site has guidelines, white papers, webinars and videos.', 'Кардіопульмональні навантажувальні тести
