AI voice avatar
Broadcasts in many languages', 'Спортивні ліги, правовласники, мовники й коментатори.', 'Sports leagues, rightsholders, broadcasters and commentators.', 'web', 'basic', 'published', 0, 'found', @uid, '2026-10-04 00:00:00' FROM DUAL WHERE @new = 1;
